      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "おそらくコロボス遺跡で\r\n魔物に襲われたのではないかと……。",
        "official_en": "I can only assume they were set upon by monsters...",
        "real_en": "We think monsters may have attacked them at Kolobos Ruins..."
