      "text": {
        "jp": "その後、様子を見に行った町の人たちも\r\n次々と帰ってこなくなってしまって……。",
        "official_en": "...and neither did anyone who was sent to investigate.",
        "real_en": "And then the townspeople who went to check on them started disappearing one after another..."
