        "official_en_sha256": "3c3c9584944c68dab6071672e60d3568f3e0e4f034bbe877868ec44cf9eb24ae"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "エマちゃんの母親が参加していた調査団は\r\nコロボス遺跡に行ったきり戻ってきてないんです。",
        "official_en": "Her mother’s expedition never returned...",
        "real_en": "The expedition Emma-chan's mother joined went to the Kolobos Ruins and never came back."
